  "description": "基于 docs/business/test/1.png 的托盘分拣线 v0.2 基线 demo：用 SceneBehaviorGraph 描述共享工件池、事件总线、backpressure 和运行状态更新。",
  "source": {
    "kind": "image_inferred_demo",
    "path": "docs/business/test/1.png"
  },
  "created_for": "展示 DeviceSpec + SceneDocument + 用户目标 -> SceneBehaviorGraph -> RuntimeSnapshot 的基线链路。",
  "references": [
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/device_data_structure.md",
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/4.SceneBehaviorGraph/schema.json",
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/1.DeviceSpec/conveyor/conveyor_1.json",
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/1.DeviceSpec/robot_arm/robot_arm_1.json",
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/1.DeviceSpec/workpiece/workpiece_1.json",
    "docs/business/SimulationSchema/1.DeviceSpec/workpiece_carrier/carrier_tray_1.json"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "当前 demo 只保留 DeviceSpec 中与场景事务推理相关的行为字段。",
    "SceneBehaviorGraph 是 Agent 生成的持久化行为建模结果。",
    "SignalBusRuntime 是 Runtime 内部模块，执行 scene_behavior_graph.event_bus 中定义的事件路由。",
    "RuntimeSnapshot 是运行时状态事实，不负责定义行为模型。",
    "当前基线不处理用户中途改需求。"
  ],
  "user_goal": {
    "goal_id": "goal_sort_pallet_parts_v0_1",
    "natural_language": "主传送带先将装有 12 个物料的托盘运到中央分拣位；两个机械臂不按固定编号分工，谁空闲谁从托盘共享工件池 claim 物料并放到可用出料传送带；出料传送带持续运行，超载时暂停对应机械臂后续抓取，负载降低后恢复，直到全部物料输出。",
    "assumptions": [
      "托盘初始位于主传送带入口侧。",
      "托盘到达中央分拣位后停止，两个机械臂开始并行分拣。",
      "两个机械臂从 pallet_1.remaining_parts 共享工件池动态 claim 物料，禁止重复 claim。",
      "目标传送带由负载均衡策略选择，优先选择未 blocked 且负载更低的传送带。",
      "每个机械臂一次只抓取一个物料，夹爪资源互斥。"
    ]
  },
